{"code":"002690","name":"동일제강","market":"KOSPI","sector_name":"철강","sector_desc":"철강재 생산·가공. 중국 공급, 원료(철광석·석탄) 가격, 건설·조선 수요에 연동되는 경기 민감 업종입니다.","desc":"동사는 1959년 선재, 강연선 등을 제조·판매할 목적으로 설립되었으며, 2015년 유가증권시장에 상장한 중소기업임. 주요 사업은 선재산업, 마봉산업, 알루미늄 세경봉산업이며, SOC사업용 PC강연선, 자동차·산업기계용 경강선 등을 생산하고 있음. 동사는 차별화된 고품질 제품으로 시장을 확보하고, 반도체 관련 판매 점유율 확대와 설비 증설로 시장 수요에 대응하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-27","n_days":299,"close":1245.0,"open":1216.0,"high":1287.0,"low":1168.0,"volume":12628,"amount":15721860.0,"ret_1d":-2.7344,"gap":-5.0,"range_pct":9.5582,"ret_5":-1.1905,"ret_20":-12.5088,"ret_60":-15.8215,"ret_120":-30.0562,"ret_250":-21.6981,"ma20":1307.9,"ma60":1417.25,"ma120":1458.025,"ma200":1519.625,"close_vs_ma200":-18.0719,"close_vs_ma60":-12.1538,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":-54.3591,"r2_60":0.679,"slope_120":-26.015,"r2_120":0.3097,"slope_250":-17.798,"r2_250":0.5181,"high52":1990.0,"low52":1168.0,"pos_52w":9.3674,"dd_52w":-37.4372,"mdd_1y":-31.6292,"atr14_pct":5.72,"vol_ann_60":38.308,"vol_avg20":63353.3,"vol_ratio20":0.1993,"vr5":0.4956,"vr20":0.3595,"amount_avg5":25617340.0,"amount_avg20":83915350.95,"amount_avg60":56244797.15,"obv_chg20":-72.4995,"turnover_20":6.2416,"pv_eff_20":-2.0041,"rsi14":38.6834,"frgn_net_5":-2834.0,"inst_net_5":423.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":-0.014,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0021,"smart_net_5_pct":-0.0119,"frgn_net_20":-85732.0,"inst_net_20":-1130.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":-0.4223,"inst_net_20_pct":-0.0056,"smart_net_20_pct":-0.4279,"frgn_net_60":-48016.0,"inst_net_60":7839.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":-0.2365,"inst_net_60_pct":0.0386,"smart_net_60_pct":-0.1979,"frgn_net_120":-150533.0,"inst_net_120":144990.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":-0.7415,"inst_net_120_pct":0.7142,"smart_net_120_pct":-0.0273,"foreign_ratio":0.92,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":-0.62,"smart_buy_streak":0,"op_income_q":4.0,"op_margin_q":0.9547,"op_qoq":null,"op_turnaround":1.0,"op_yoy":500.0,"rev_yoy":8.8312,"op_trend_4q":57.7778,"fin_period":"202606","roe":0.51,"debt_ratio":12.15,"per":31.92,"pbr":0.16,"div_yiel